{"4309180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Holding Pattern", "steam_appid": 4309180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding Pattern is a minimal incremental game about protecting your galaxy from invaders. Ascend through multiple galaxies, discover new moons and powerful abilities. How far will you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fancy seeing how far you can go with only 1 life, random events and legendary skills to pick from? Check out the roguelike mode! Want a more classic, controlled progression? Then incremental mode is for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend against invaders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how long your can protect your planet from incoming invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/0525c348cc68d2cb946ce51dbadad42b.poster.avif?t=1776890453\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/0525c348cc68d2cb946ce51dbadad42b.webm?t=1776890453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/0525c348cc68d2cb946ce51dbadad42b.mp4?t=1776890453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your galaxy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your galaxies defences to improve your odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/7f4d4ae2994b67bff5276d8430411ef6.poster.avif?t=1776890453\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/7f4d4ae2994b67bff5276d8430411ef6.webm?t=1776890453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/7f4d4ae2994b67bff5276d8430411ef6.mp4?t=1776890453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn cash!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn cash from each stage and reinvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/c0dd38c7e81c1c964defefc7c7ac4905.avif?t=1776890453\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand beyond!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend into the unknown, grow your galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/eec55a6570b00d0b6d8f83bbbff6abf6.avif?t=1776890453\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding Pattern is a minimal incremental game about protecting your galaxy from invaders. Ascend through multiple galaxies, discover new moons and powerful abilities. How far will you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fancy seeing how far you can go with only 1 life, random events and legendary skills to pick from? Check out the roguelike mode! Want a more classic, controlled progression? Then incremental mode is for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend against invaders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how long your can protect your planet from incoming invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309180/extras/0525c348cc68d2cb946ce51dbadad42b.poster.avif?t=1776890453\" width=1170